# Prettier already honours .gitignore, so most build output needs no entry
# here. Two things still do: files git tracks but no one writes by hand, and
# generated directories .gitignore only covers in part.

# --- Tracked, but generated: formatting them would fight the tool that writes them
package-lock.json
CHANGELOG.md
projects/*/CHANGELOG.md

# --- Generated directories .gitignore does not cover in full
# .gitignore only lists /.angular/cache, and nothing for the nx cache lerna brings
.angular
.nx

# --- Build and tool output, also gitignored: kept explicit so an invocation
# passing --ignore-path (which drops .gitignore) still skips them
dist
out-tsc
bazel-out
tmp
coverage
node_modules

# --- Agent worktrees: another session's checkout, not this project's source
.claude
